# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, also on Windows with core.autocrlf=true. gofmt (and so
# compilar.ps1 -Verificar and CI) rejects Go files with CRLF; the rest follow so a clone looks the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
